PaperLens database migrations.

Run from the project root:

    uv run alembic upgrade head
    uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"
    uv run alembic check

`migrations/env.py` loads the app settings and uses `DATABASE_URL`, or
`TEST_DATABASE_URL` when `APP_ENV=test`. The application does not create
tables at startup; migrations are the source of truth for the schema.
